Objective:
Create a Student Registration Form using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
Requirements:
  Fields:
o  Full Name
o  Email
o  Mobile Number
o  Age
o  Gender (Radio buttons)
o  Course (Dropdown)
o  Submit button
Validation Rules:
  Name should not be empty.
  Email should be in proper format.
  Mobile number should contain exactly 10 digits.
  Age should be between 18 and 60.
  All fields are mandatory.
Output:
  Show validation messages below each field.
  On successful submission, display:
  Registration Successful!